@startuml C4-Dynamic-Overview
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Dynamic — Explore IAM overview (govern → onboard → sign in → access → audit)

autonumber
actor "IAM Administrator\n/ Auditor" as admin
actor "App Developer" as dev
actor "End User" as user
participant "Business App\nRelying Party (web / iOS)" as rp <<ui>>
participant "Business API\nResource Server" as rs <<java>>
participant "IAM Application :9100\nConsole · REST · OIDC Provider" as iam <<java>>
participant "External IdP\nGoogle / GitHub" as idp <<external>>
database "Metadata DB" as db <<db>>

== Govern identity and policy ==
admin -> iam: Console → /api/v1/users · groups · roles\npolicies · permissionPoints
iam -> iam: Method Security (IAM_ADMIN)
iam -> db: Save aggregates + ManagementEvent
iam --> admin: 201 / 200

== Onboard a Relying Party ==
dev -> iam: POST /api/v1/clients\n(redirect URIs, scopes, PKCE for public clients)
iam -> db: Save OidcClient → RegisteredClient\n+ ManagementEvent
iam --> dev: client_id (+ client_secret if confidential)
dev -> rp: Configure issuer, client_id, redirect URI

== Sign in (SSO) ==
user -> rp: Open app
rp -> iam: /oauth2/authorize (Authorization Code + PKCE)
alt No IAM session
  iam --> user: Login Page (/login)
  user -> iam: Form Login
  opt Federated login
    iam <-> idp: OAuth2 Login → FederatedIdentityLink
  end
  iam -> db: Authentication Event → ManagementEvent
end
iam --> rp: Redirect with code
rp -> iam: POST /oauth2/token
iam --> rp: Access Token (sub, email, permissions)\n+ ID / Refresh Token
ref over rp, iam : C4-Dynamic-SSOLogin · C4-Dynamic-NativePkceLogin

== Call protected APIs ==
rp -> rs: Authorization: Bearer access_token
rs -> iam: /.well-known/jwks.json (cached)
rs -> rs: Verify iss, signature, exp;\nscope → SCOPE_* authorities
rs --> rp: 200 / 403

== Temporary credentials (STS, optional) ==
admin -> iam: POST /api/v1/sts/assume-role\n(roleArn, sessionName; IAM session)
iam -> db: Save AssumedRoleSession\n+ ManagementEvent (sts:AssumeRole)
iam --> admin: Temporary JWT (role_arn, expiresAt)
ref over admin, iam : C4-Dynamic-PolicyEvaluation

== Review and what-if ==
admin -> iam: GET /api/v1/auditEvents
iam -> db: Query ManagementEvent + AuthorizationDecisionLog
iam --> admin: Audit events
admin -> iam: POST /api/v1/policies:evaluate
iam -> iam: PolicyEngine:\nexplicit Deny > Allow > implicit Deny
iam -> db: Append AuthorizationDecisionLog
iam --> admin: Decision + ReasonCode

note over rs, iam
  As-built: tokens carry no aud yet;
  PolicyEngine runs only via :evaluate (what-if)
end note

@enduml
